#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#1 (mes)
- "- You cannot proceed because you have too many items with you. -"
+ "- Você não pode prosseguir porque está com itens demais. -"
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#2 (mes)
- "[Dimension Traveler]"
+ "[Viajante Dimensional]"
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#3 (mes)
- "Adventurer friend, "
+ "Amigo aventureiro, "
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#4 (mes)
- " is what I need. How about exchanging it with something I have?"
+ " é do que eu preciso. Que tal trocar por alguma coisa que eu tenho?"
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#5 (select)
- "Show me your weapon."
+ "Me mostre a sua arma."
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#6 (select)
- "Show me your armor."
+ "Me mostre a sua armadura."
#: npc/re/merchants/ghost_palace_exchange.txt#7 (select)
